## 核心结论（先读这段）

本仓库把三个概念**刻意分开**：

| 概念 | 判断依据 | 是否依赖登录 |
|------|----------|------------|
| **当前 BLE 已连接** | `bleSessionProvider.isConnected`（原生蓝牙连接回调） | 否 |
| **本机曾经连接过** | 本地 `ConnectedDeviceRecord`（`isLocalConnection: true`） | 否（但按账号分区存储） |
| **账号已绑定** | `ConnectedDeviceRecord.equipmentId != null`（`isAccountBound`） | 是（需调服务端 API） |

**不存在**读取系统蓝牙「已配对列表」的逻辑；「已知设备」完全来自 App 自管的本地 JSON 缓存 + 服务端设备列表合并。

---

## 1. 两个 Controller 的状态来源

### 1.1 `ConnectedDevicesController` — 本地持久化 + 服务端同步

**启动时：先读本地，登录后再拉服务端合并。**

`build()` 从 `StorageService`（底层 SharedPreferences）按账号 scope 读 JSON，**不发网络请求**：

```25:37:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/connected_devices_controller.dart
  List<ConnectedDeviceRecord> build() {
    _accountScope = ref.watch(deviceAccountScopeProvider);
    _syncingFromAccount = false;
    final raw = ref.read(storageServiceProvider).getString(_storageKey);
    if (raw == null || raw.isEmpty) {
      return const [];
    }
    final decoded = jsonDecode(raw) as List<dynamic>;
    return [
      for (final item in decoded)
        ConnectedDeviceRecord.fromJson(item as Map<String, dynamic>),
    ];
  }
```

存储键格式：`feature_device_connect.connected_devices.{userId}`，未登录时为 `anonymous`：

```532:534:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/connected_devices_controller.dart
  String get _storageKey => _storageKeyFor(_accountScope.storageKey);

  String _storageKeyFor(String scopeKey) => '$_connectedDevicesKey.$scopeKey';
```

账号 scope 由 App 注入当前登录 uid：

```123:126:apps/glasses_app/lib/app.dart
        deviceAccountScopeProvider.overrideWith(
          (ref) =>
              DeviceAccountScope(userId: ref.watch(authSessionProvider)?.uid),
        ),
```

**登录成功 / 冷启动恢复 session 后**，App 层 hook 触发 `syncFromAccount()` 请求服务端：

```161:166:apps/glasses_app/lib/app.dart
        // 登录成功/冷启动恢复已登录 session 后同步账号绑定设备列表。
        authLoginHandlerProvider.overrideWith(
          (ref) =>
              () =>
                  ref.read(connectedDevicesProvider.notifier).syncFromAccount(),
        ),
```

`authBootstrapProvider` 在冷启动恢复 session 时同样调用：

```36:38:packages/feature/account/feature_account_auth/lib/src/service/auth_providers.dart
  if (session != null) {
    await ref.read(authLoginHandlerProvider)?.call();
  }
```

**合并策略**（有意比原生保守）：

```307:314:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/connected_devices_controller.dart
  /// 用账号绑定设备列表刷新本地记录。
  ///
  /// 对齐原生 `LoginRepository.initUserInfo()` → `DeviceDao.syncBindDevices`，
  /// 但合并语义有意更保守：只用服务端数据覆盖按 `mac` 匹配到的本地记录（写
  /// `equipmentId`/`deviceCode`/`deviceVersion`/`name`），服务端独有的设备追加
  /// 为已知设备；**不删除**任何本地记录。原生会在服务端列表里找不到本地非
  /// temp 设备时直接删除，本仓库认为这在接口失败/临时返回空列表时有误删风险，
  /// 故不照抄。同一时间只允许一次同步在途。
```

### 1.2 `ConnectedDeviceRecord` 字段

```4:88:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/model/connected_device_record.dart
  const ConnectedDeviceRecord({
    required this.deviceId,
    required this.name,
    required this.connectedAt,
    this.hardwareAddress,
    this.isLocalConnection = false,
    this.deviceCode = '',
    this.snCode = '',
    this.deviceVersion = '',
    this.equipmentId,
    this.boundProductId,
    this.boundChipType,
    // ... failure/scan metadata ...
  });

  /// Platform BLE remote id.
  final String deviceId;

  /// 后端绑定使用的硬件地址；不得由 [deviceId] 推测。
  final String? hardwareAddress;

  /// 是否已在当前手机上成功建立过连接。
  final bool isLocalConnection;

  /// Bound business device code from the account/device model.
  final String deviceCode;

  /// Device SN cached from the bound device model or device-info read.
  final String snCode;

  /// Backend device id returned by `user/auth/device/connect`.
  final int? equipmentId;

  /// Whether this device has been bound to the account backend.
  bool get isAccountBound => equipmentId != null;
```

- `deviceId`：平台 BLE remote id（iOS 上可能是 CoreBluetooth UUID，**不是真实 MAC**）
- `hardwareAddress`：后端绑定/合并用的 MAC，**必须由原生层明确提供**
- `isLocalConnection`：本机是否真正连通过（`recordConnected` 时设为 `true`）
- `equipmentId`：账号绑定的核心标志；`null` = 未绑定（原生称 "temp" 设备）

### 1.3 `DeviceIdentitySyncController` — BLE 握手驱动身份写入 + 触发绑定

监听 `bleSessionProvider` 连接状态，连接成功后启动身份握手；收到 `0x92` 设备信息后写本地并尝试账号绑定：

```186:211:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_identity_sync_controller.dart
    await ref
        .read(connectedDevicesProvider.notifier)
        .recordIdentity(
          deviceId: deviceId,
          hardwareAddress: session.hardwareAddress,
          deviceName: session.deviceName,
          deviceCode: deviceCode,
          deviceVersion: otaVersionCode,
        );
    // ...
    final bindResult = await ref
        .read(connectedDevicesProvider.notifier)
        .bindToAccountIfNeeded(deviceId);
```

`_hasCurrentDevice()` 用 **`isAccountBound`**（不是「连接过」）决定握手重连响应：

```361:367:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_identity_sync_controller.dart
  bool _hasCurrentDevice() {
    final deviceId = ref.read(bleSessionProvider).deviceId;
    return ref
            .read(connectedDevicesProvider.notifier)
            .byDeviceId(deviceId)
            ?.isAccountBound ??
        false;
  }
```

