## 2. 服务端设备绑定 API

全部在 `feature_device_connect` 的 `DeviceAccountService`：

| 方法 | HTTP | 用途 |
|------|------|------|
| `bindDevice()` | `POST user/auth/device/connect` | BLE 身份握手后绑定到当前账号 |
| `untieDevice()` | `POST user/auth/device/untie` | 解绑 |
| `fetchDeviceList()` | `GET user/auth/device/list` | 拉取账号已绑定设备列表 |

```5:14:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/service/device_account_api_paths.dart
abstract final class DeviceAccountApiPaths {
  static const connect = 'user/auth/device/connect';
  static const untie = 'user/auth/device/untie';
  static const list = 'user/auth/device/list';
}
```

绑定触发时机：`bindToAccountIfNeeded()` — 已有 `deviceCode` + `hardwareAddress` 且 `equipmentId == null` 时才调 API；已绑定则跳过（必要时补一次 `syncFromAccount`）：

```211:218:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/connected_devices_controller.dart
    if (record.isAccountBound) {
      // 老记录可能是在引入 boundProductId/boundChipType 之前绑定的；补一次账号
      // 设备列表同步回填，而不是要求用户重新解绑/绑定。
      if (!record.hasBoundIdentity) {
        unawaited(syncFromAccount(locale: locale));
      }
      return const Result.success(null);
    }
```

`packages/common/` 下**没有**设备绑定 service；绑定逻辑集中在 `feature_device_connect`。

---

## 3. BLE「已连接」vs 账号「已绑定」

### BLE 连接（纯本地/传输层）

`BleSessionController` 监听原生 `BleService` 连接事件，更新 `BleSessionState`：

```39:50:packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_session_controller.dart
    _connectionSubscription = events.listen((event) {
      if (event.state == BleConnectionState.disconnected) {
        _resetSession();
      }
      state = state.copyWith(
        connectionState: event.state,
        deviceId: event.deviceId,
        hardwareAddress: event.hardwareAddress,
        // ...
      );
    });
```

```29:30:packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/model/ble_session_state.dart
  /// Whether GATT (or vendor) link is established.
  bool get isConnected => connectionState == BleConnectionState.connected;
```

`common_ble_protocol` 的 `GlassesDeviceState` 同样直接读 `bleSessionProvider.isConnected`，与账号绑定无关：

```80:93:packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/model/glasses_device_state.dart
    final session = ref.watch(bleSessionProvider);

    if (!session.isConnected) {
      // Clear accumulated fields on disconnect.
      _isWorn = null;
      // ...
      return GlassesDeviceState(
        isConnected: false,
        deviceId: session.deviceId,
        deviceName: session.deviceName,
      );
    }
```

连接成功时 `DeviceConnectController` 写本地「连接过」记录（**不等同于账号绑定**）：

```114:122:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_connect_controller.dart
    if (result case Success()) {
      final session = ref.read(bleSessionProvider);
      await ref
          .read(connectedDevicesProvider.notifier)
          .recordConnected(
            deviceId: session.deviceId ?? deviceId,
            hardwareAddress: session.hardwareAddress,
            deviceName: session.deviceName ?? deviceName,
          );
```

**结论：BLE 已连接 = 传输层状态；账号已绑定 = `equipmentId` 存在。两者独立，通过身份握手 + API 串联。**

---

## 4. 登录/登出时的设备数据处理

### 登录
1. `connectedDevicesProvider` 因 `deviceAccountScopeProvider` 变化 **rebuild**，加载该 uid 的本地缓存
2. `authLoginHandler` → `syncFromAccount()` 拉服务端列表并合并

### 登出
`authLogoutHandler` **只断开 BLE，不清本地设备记录**：

```167:172:apps/glasses_app/lib/app.dart
        authLogoutHandlerProvider.overrideWith(
          (ref) => () async {
            ref.read(userDisconnectRequestedProvider.notifier).set(true);
            await ref.read(bleSessionProvider.notifier).disconnect();
          },
        ),
```

`logout()` 先清 session，再调 hook；scope 变为 `anonymous`，provider rebuild 加载匿名分区缓存：

```255:262:packages/feature/account/feature_account_auth/lib/src/service/auth_controller.dart
  Future<void> logout() async {
    final logoutHandler = ref.read(authLogoutHandlerProvider);
    ref.read(authSessionProvider.notifier).setSession(null);
    // ...
    await logoutHandler?.call();
  }
```

### 换账号
`DeviceConnectController` 和 `DeviceForegroundReconnectController` 监听 scope 变化，**断开 BLE + 停止重连**，然后加载新账号的本地分区：

```47:62:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_connect_controller.dart
    ref.listen<DeviceAccountScope>(deviceAccountScopeProvider, (
      previous,
      next,
    ) {
      if (previous != null && previous.storageKey != next.storageKey) {
        _cancelForAccountChange();
      }
    });
  // ...
  void _cancelForAccountChange() {
    ref.read(userDisconnectRequestedProvider.notifier).set(true);
    // ...
    unawaited(ref.read(bleSessionProvider.notifier).disconnect());
  }
```

测试证实账号间记录隔离（换 uid → 列表为空或切回旧 uid 的数据）：

```718:750:packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/test/connected_devices_test.dart
  test('keeps connected-device records isolated by account scope', () async {
    // ...
    container.read(_testDeviceAccountScopeProvider.notifier)
        .set(const DeviceAccountScope(userId: 2));
    await pumpEventQueue();
    expect(container.read(connectedDevicesProvider), isEmpty);
    // ...
    container.read(_testDeviceAccountScopeProvider.notifier)
        .set(const DeviceAccountScope(userId: 1));
    await pumpEventQueue();
    expect(
      container.read(connectedDevicesProvider).map((record) => record.deviceId),
      ['A1'],
    );
  });
```

